Notes: stations.txt fixes the 34 stations: the script picked them from the archive's index page,
  read live at every run, and the archive has listed more since (DGAR, POL2, DARW by 2026-10-14).
  The observation files are decompressed by RNXCMP's crx2rnx (tools/third_party/rnxcmp, make
  crx2rnx).

Written by `fog build explain` from data/gps/dataset.json and the lock files: edit those, not this file.
